	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Tam ingens est pelagus, reverende in Christo pater, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>eorum quae te scire velim, ut, unde ordiar, non <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>inveniam; sic ipsa copia me facit inopem.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Adde, quod literis non omnia tuto concredantur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Quod ergo d. <persName ref="p8071">Voglerum</persName> mihi etiam atque etiam commendasti, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>in eius sinum multa secreto effudi, ex quo <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>tu prolixe omnia.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Videmur tibi stolide rem admini<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>strare; id mirum non usque adeo est sic tibi videri, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>qui consilii nostri causas satis graves pernoscere <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>non potuisti; exposui eas quoque d. Voglero.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Nihil <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>hic temere factum est, sed tamen festinanter omnia, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>propterea quod <persName>Philippi</persName> legatus ex improviso nos <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>oppresserit.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Quod ad illum attinet, ad quem novissime <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>scripsisti, etsi consiliis nostris interest, tamen, quia <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>nunc ad gubernacula sedet, timendum est, ne <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>ita aperte alterum offendere velit, non quod noster no<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>n sit, sed quod pecuniae credantur utrinque inter<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>venire.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Quid ego fecerim, quid faciam, dicet <persName ref="p8071">Voglerus</persName>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">- <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Synodus nostra duravit totum triduum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Nullę leges, nullus <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ordo, interim toties concionandum in conventu tot <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>et tantorum virorum.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Plane fractus sum, et nisi <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>meliora tempora subsequantur, studiis salus omnino <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>dicenda est.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Sed haec me non multum movent.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Ille <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>nebulo ter maximus, de quo tibi coram, qui <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>pecuniis in dies et horas dominos permutare <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>solet, maxime mihi fuit adversus (qui quid <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>in comitiis <persName>Ilantii</persName> tentarit, nosti).</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Sed spero <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>eum mea ipsius modestia oppugnatum iri; nunc <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>ipsius nequitia non paucis innotuit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><foreign xml:lang="de">Er hat sich in sinodo mir <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>häfftig widerleit</foreign> (sed mea sententia apud omnes bonos vicit).</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de">Syn red <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>hat er also beschlossen: man sölle dem <persName>Philippo</persName> nütt abschlachen <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>und dem <placeName ref="l832">Franzosen</placeName> nütt zuͦsagen; <foreign xml:lang="la">cupit nebulo ducere negotium, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>ut interim mulgeat utrumque.</foreign></s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">- Cupis scire, quid actum sit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Audi <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>breviter.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de">Dem <placeName ref="l832">Franzosen</placeName> ist ein antwurt worden; so verr er die <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>alten ansprachen abbezale, wölle man in güttigklich verhören und <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>syn handel für die gemeinden kommen laßen; dem philippischen n[un], <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>so er sy nit entbären, wölle man im syn begär ouch für die gemeinden <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>kommen laßen.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de">Daruff im ein pundtstag angesetzt <foreign xml:lang="la">(id nostrorum <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>consilio factum)</foreign> uff mitten augsten.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de">Er hat vermeint, grad yetz <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>den handel durchin ze trucken, <foreign xml:lang="la">sed frustra;</foreign> daruff er geantwortet, <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>er wölle die ding hinder sich an synen könig langen laßen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="de">Mag man al<lb xml:id="p2z14"/>so nitt wüßen, was geschicht.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Hęc summa.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Interim <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>quid tentarit, quot sibi conciliarit, quae largitiones, quanta profusio, <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>audies ex <persName ref="p8071">Voglero</persName>.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Haec summatim.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Promiserat d. legatus <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>se hoc vesperi suum ad me responsum missurum; sed puto <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>praepeditum tot negotiis non potuisse.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Spero me integra acta <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>cum <persName ref="p8071">Voglero</persName> missurum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, reverende pater, et nos edocere <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>perge de iis, quae negotio nostro conducere possunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Curię</placeName> 5. iunii anno 1564.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z21"/>T[uus] <persName ref="p8009">F[abricius</persName>].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Ohne Adresse.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
